+# Helpdesk MCP server
+
+Add to `claude_desktop_config.json`:
+
+```json
+{
+  "mcpServers": {
+    "helpdesk": { "command": "python", "args": ["-m", "helpdesk_mcp.server"] }
+  }
+}
+```
+
+The model will ask you for your Helpdesk API key the first time it calls a tool —
+paste it into the chat and it will pass it along on each call.
